#: src/Core/Main.vala:3151
msgid "Snapshot will become active after system is rebooted."
msgstr "Avbilden aktiveras när systemet startas om."

#: src/Gtk/DeleteFinishBox.vala:60
msgid "Snapshot(s) Deleted"
